{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Game Description</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A textless puzzle game made in imitation of the Charlie Brown style of painting. The story unfolds in an otherworldly world designed in reference to Utopia, in a fantastical and grotesque style.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Multiple effects of items</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each item may trigger unexpected effects in different scenarios.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407310/extras/apple.gif?t=1744501907\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407310/extras/giveApple.gif?t=1744501907\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Rich animation</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game uses a lot of hand-drawn frame animations to enrich the gaming experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407310/extras/qianqi.gif?t=1744501907\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>New way to solve puzzles</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">On top of the traditional puzzle gameplay, add the design of wrong endings, after triggering the wrong endings will be resurrected in the same place and start again. The game has a total of three chapters, and each chapter contains more than 6 wrong endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407310/extras/chuizi.gif?t=1744501907\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Achievement Collector</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game has a total of 47 achievements buried in 3 maps, 19 scenarios, and 23 endings for you to explore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407310/extras/QQ20250315-191213.png?t=1744501907\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Background</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>the moon</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A certain master wanted to test the question of \u201cwhether there is a utopia where everyone is free from worries\u201d, so he created a lunar society and lunar natives by referring to the creatures of the Earth, and allowed them to develop without any intervention.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>In the end, the utopia of no worries for everyone was actually realized.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Since the moon is barren and has no food, and the lunar natives have no reproduction system, they will randomly capture earthlings to replenish their numbers, and obedient earthlings with problem-solving abilities will be treated well, and these earthlings will help the natives solve all their troubles. Those who were obedient and capable of solving problems would be treated well, and these Earths would help the natives solve all their problems, while those who were incompetent or rebellious would be used as ingredients and cooked into delicious dishes. Thus, the moon natives would all be free of worries, and utopia would be born.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407310/extras/map1.png?t=1744501907\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407310/extras/map2.png?t=1744501907\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>paradise</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The place where earthlings go after death is the place where all happiness is gathered, and all those things on earth that are extremely difficult to obtain, such as those wealth, power, desires, happiness and so on, can be easily obtained here. But those who come here will slowly lose their previous memories and their bodies will slowly degenerate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407310/extras/map3.png?t=1744501907\" /></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Violent Unboxing","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3407310/cb8329fc75be7205aa772a1b13f390d234f9f609.jpg"},{"name":"First Encounter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3407310/c9fbbabe15f58b1f1abdf85dc8f77c8797d6c5b1.jpg"},{"name":"Mediation","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3407310/b3baffb4731f56ff45aada3e0fcc304c3b303e37.jpg"},{"name":"Master Chef","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3407310/a5cca4063d72f6faaf9d585c74d094ce5d1823f5.jpg"},{"name":"Eating Dirt","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3407310/1ec5996e4f738075141a19e171fb9cf6d835a8b5.jpg"},{"name":"Fall","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3407310/bb3ed977291ce83ce5b3f129b2c484b422dcc7e3.jpg"},{"name":"Burn I","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3407310/7188050d088dd4d5767ea51c1208ce6ab27cc9e5.jpg"},{"name":"Nibbling","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3407310/ccaf37574d770d06c286c94e5eeb02285f1cdbfc.jpg"},{"name":"Bitter Gift","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3407310/4364709a5fd4801ac8fe6a7e194c6dde61665e34.jpg"},{"name":"Fireworks","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3407310/5265bd7ad473f1c373b2ef45f7b1a161ed5b4702.jpg"}],"total":47},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3407310?t=1744501907","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3407310?t=1744501907","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407310/3b31ab2f131e23e15f39a46b0c78974935a2a04a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744501907","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407310/3b31ab2f131e23e15f39a46b0c78974935a2a04a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744501907","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Game Description</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A textless puzzle game made in imitation of the Charlie Brown style of painting. The story unfolds in an otherworldly world designed in reference to Utopia, in a fantastical and grotesque style.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Multiple effects of items</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each item may trigger unexpected effects in different scenarios.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407310/extras/apple.gif?t=1744501907\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407310/extras/giveApple.gif?t=1744501907\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Rich animation</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game uses a lot of hand-drawn frame animations to enrich the gaming experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407310/extras/qianqi.gif?t=1744501907\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>New way to solve puzzles</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">On top of the traditional puzzle gameplay, add the design of wrong endings, after triggering the wrong endings will be resurrected in the same place and start again. The game has a total of three chapters, and each chapter contains more than 6 wrong endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407310/extras/chuizi.gif?t=1744501907\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Achievement Collector</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game has a total of 47 achievements buried in 3 maps, 19 scenarios, and 23 endings for you to explore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407310/extras/QQ20250315-191213.png?t=1744501907\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Background</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>the moon</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A certain master wanted to test the question of \u201cwhether there is a utopia where everyone is free from worries\u201d, so he created a lunar society and lunar natives by referring to the creatures of the Earth, and allowed them to develop without any intervention.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>In the end, the utopia of no worries for everyone was actually realized.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Since the moon is barren and has no food, and the lunar natives have no reproduction system, they will randomly capture earthlings to replenish their numbers, and obedient earthlings with problem-solving abilities will be treated well, and these earthlings will help the natives solve all their troubles. Those who were obedient and capable of solving problems would be treated well, and these Earths would help the natives solve all their problems, while those who were incompetent or rebellious would be used as ingredients and cooked into delicious dishes. Thus, the moon natives would all be free of worries, and utopia would be born.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407310/extras/map1.png?t=1744501907\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407310/extras/map2.png?t=1744501907\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>paradise</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The place where earthlings go after death is the place where all happiness is gathered, and all those things on earth that are extremely difficult to obtain, such as those wealth, power, desires, happiness and so on, can be easily obtained here. But those who come here will slowly lose their previous memories and their bodies will slowly degenerate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407310/extras/map3.png?t=1744501907\" /></p>","developers":["SpringBone"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407310/f1c47d403780ec7be2b1846e8330951ec2c96b61/header.jpg?t=1744501907","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257082248,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257082248/movie480.mp4?t=1742434335","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257082248/movie_max.mp4?t=1742434335"},"name":"screen recording","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/25